<title>ARGENTINA: S.Korea buys 100,000 T Argentine maize - traders.</title>
<headline>S.Korea buys 100,000 T Argentine maize - traders.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea bought 100,000 tonnes of Argentine maize for April to May shipment, Argentine traders said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The maize was bought in two, 50,000-tonne lots, from Tradigrain at $133.95, and from Cargill at $136.50, they said.</p>
